#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.insert.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.insert"
msgstr "cuda.tile.insert"

#: cuda.tile._stub.insert:1 of
msgid "Stores a smaller tile into a bigger tile."
msgstr "将较小的子 Tile 写入（替换）到较大的 Tile 中。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.insert:3 of
msgid ""
"Returns a new tile whose elements match ``x``, except in the subtile at "
"the given grid ``index``, whose elements match ``value``. This is the "
"inverse of :py:func:`extract`: the shape of the inserted subtile is taken"
" from ``value``, and ``extract(insert(x, index, value), index, "
"value.shape)`` reproduces ``value``."
msgstr ""
"返回一个新 Tile：除给定网格 ``index`` 处的子 Tile 元素替换为 ``value`` 外，其余元素均与 ``x`` 一致。这是 "
":py:func:`extract` 的逆操作：插入子 Tile 的形状由 ``value`` 决定，且 ``extract(insert(x, "
"index, value), index, value.shape)`` 将还原出 ``value`` 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.insert:9 of
msgid ""
"Like all tile operations, this does not mutate ``x`` in place; it returns"
" a new tile."
msgstr "与所有 Tile 操作一样，该操作不会原地修改 ``x`` ，而是返回一个新的 Tile。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.insert.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.insert:12 of
msgid "destination tile."
msgstr "目标 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.insert:14 of
msgid ""
"Index into the grid of subtiles, not element index. Each dimension ``i`` "
"has ``x.shape[i] // value.shape[i]`` subtiles; valid values are ``[0, "
"x.shape[i] // value.shape[i])``."
msgstr ""
"子 Tile 网格中的索引（而非元素级索引）。每个维度 ``i`` 包含 ``x.shape[i] // value.shape[i]`` 个子 "
"Tile；有效值为 ``[0, x.shape[i] // value.shape[i])`` 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.insert:18 of
msgid ""
"subtile to store. Its shape must evenly divide ``x.shape`` in every "
"dimension. A 0-d ``value`` is treated as a unit subtile."
msgstr "要存入的子 Tile。其形状必须在每个维度上都能整除 ``x.shape`` 。零维（0-d） ``value`` 会被视为单位大小的子 Tile。"

